*.zip

# Scratch notes handed to `gh release create --notes-file` / `git commit -F`; the real record is
# changelog.md and the commit itself. PowerShell has no heredoc, so these files are the way a
# multi-line message is passed at all.
release-notes-*.md
.release-notes.md
.commit-msg.txt
msg.txt
